{
    "prompt": "\"Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. If object visible, approach it, grab it or scan area for it; Move to destination; check and process object. list of available nodes: <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <Action ID = MoveToDestination    /> <Action ID = GrabObject    /> <SubTree ID = CheckObjectProperties    /> <SubTree ID = ProcessObject    /> <Action ID = ScanAreaForObject    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectWithinReach    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectApproached    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectGrabbed    />\"",
    "BT": {
